{"id":"n66282-1-10","stage":3,"title":"실내 · 室内","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66282-1-10-1","ko":"날씨도 추운데 우리 실내로 들어갈까요?","zh":"天气这么冷，我们进室内吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"날씨도","meaning":"天气","explanation":"날씨：天气；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"날씨","audio":"/audio/fe655cf1d979cf3db76c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60630","senseId":"1","lemma":"날씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"날씨도","audio":"/audio/0933cc8d3e4f29fc2621.mp3"}},{"text":"추운데","meaning":"冷","explanation":"춥다：冷；은데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"춥다","audio":"/audio/7c651efb56d12a6540a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72146","senseId":"2","lemma":"춥다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"추운데","audio":"/audio/6924e9cc82b9e32a468b.mp3"}},{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"실내로","meaning":"室内","explanation":"실내：室内；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"실내","audio":"/audio/9082214effb119dbb66e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66282","senseId":"1","lemma":"실내","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"실내로","audio":"/audio/7213f40b501d135be19f.mp3"}},{"text":"들어갈까요?","meaning":"进，进去","explanation":"들어가다：进，进去；ㄹ까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"들어가다","audio":"/audio/5a3b0d8b05ae781d7f0f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67877","senseId":"1","lemma":"들어가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들어갈까요","audio":"/audio/0bd0f5d7403bff4860a4.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"fe655cf1d979cf3d","term":"날씨","zh":"天气","audio":"/audio/fe655cf1d979cf3db76c.mp3","entryId":"60630","definition":"每天在气温或空气中出现的，如雨、云、风、雾等的状况。","pronunciation":["날씨"]},{"id":"7c651efb56d12a65","term":"춥다","zh":"冷","audio":"/audio/7c651efb56d12a6540a4.mp3","entryId":"72146","definition":"大气温度低。","pronunciation":["춥따"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"9082214effb119db","term":"실내","zh":"室内","audio":"/audio/9082214effb119dbb66e.mp3","entryId":"66282","definition":"房间或建筑等的里面。","pronunciation":["실래"]},{"id":"5a3b0d8b05ae781d","term":"들어가다","zh":"进，进去","audio":"/audio/5a3b0d8b05ae781d7f0f.mp3","entryId":"67877","definition":"由外往里去。","pronunciation":["드러가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/dfdff054ea90e5238de8.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n66282-1-10-2","ko":"좋아요. 그럼 저기 보이는 찻집에 들어가요.","zh":"好啊，那就进那边那家茶馆吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"좋아요.","meaning":"行，可以","explanation":"좋다：行，可以；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"12","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋아요","audio":"/audio/4e89f12afd275d8a286b.mp3"}},{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}},{"text":"저기","meaning":"那里，那儿","explanation":"저기：那里，那儿","readings":[{"term":"저기","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71218","senseId":"1","lemma":"저기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저기","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3"}},{"text":"보이는","meaning":"看得见的","explanation":"보이다：看见、映入眼帘；本句指那边看得到的茶馆；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"1","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보이는","audio":"/audio/401b2c331fa5766871a6.mp3"}},{"text":"찻집에","meaning":"茶馆，茶楼，茶社","explanation":"찻집：茶馆，茶楼，茶社；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"찻집","audio":"/audio/f661c2b181d3d38d8e74.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"78772","senseId":"1","lemma":"찻집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찻집에","audio":"/audio/5e56a2639a0ff5ca0a4c.mp3"}},{"text":"들어가요.","meaning":"进，进去","explanation":"들어가다：进，进去；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"들어가다","audio":"/audio/5a3b0d8b05ae781d7f0f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67877","senseId":"1","lemma":"들어가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들어가요","audio":"/audio/33e06d16394675bf4df1.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"行，可以","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"某个行动或事情等不成问题。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"1a8b5723b01cfd93","term":"저기","zh":"那里，那儿","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3","entryId":"71218","definition":"指代离说话人或听话人很远的地方。","pronunciation":["저기"]},{"id":"da6f27438e6f345c","term":"보이다","zh":"看见、映入眼帘；本句指那边看得到的茶馆","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3","entryId":"62091","definition":"看见、映入眼帘；本句指那边看得到的茶馆","pronunciation":["보이다"]},{"id":"f661c2b181d3d38d","term":"찻집","zh":"茶馆，茶楼，茶社","audio":"/audio/f661c2b181d3d38d8e74.mp3","entryId":"78772","definition":"售卖茶或饮料等的地方。","pronunciation":["차찝","찯찝"]},{"id":"5a3b0d8b05ae781d","term":"들어가다","zh":"进，进去","audio":"/audio/5a3b0d8b05ae781d7f0f.mp3","entryId":"67877","definition":"由外往里去。","pronunciation":["드러가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5e9fa33695a81f6ae51a.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.9,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=66282","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creat